flowchart TB
  GQL[Spring GraphQL]
  GQL --> SCHEMA[Schema Definition]
  SCHEMA --> TYPES[Types]
  SCHEMA --> QUERY[Query Operations]
  SCHEMA --> MUT[Mutation Operations]
  SCHEMA --> SUB[Subscription Operations]

  GQL --> ANNO[Annotations]
  ANNO --> QM[QueryMapping]
  ANNO --> MM[MutationMapping]
  ANNO --> SM[SubscriptionMapping]
  ANNO --> SCHM[SchemaMapping]

  GQL --> FETCH[Data Fetching]
  FETCH --> DF[DataFetcher]
  FETCH --> DL[DataLoader / BatchMapping]
  FETCH --> EAG[Eager Loading]

  GQL --> SUB2[Subscriptions]
  SUB2 --> WS[WebSocket Transport]
  SUB2 --> EVT[Event-Driven]

  GQL --> UI[Exploration Tools]
  UI --> GQLI[GraphiQL]
  UI --> VOY[GraphQL Voyager]

  GQL --> SEC[Security]
  SEC --> SPM[Spring Security]
  SEC --> AUTH[Field-Level Auth]

  GQL --> PAGIN[Pagination]
  PAGIN --> CUR[Cursor-Based]
  PAGIN --> OFF[Offset-Based]

  GQL --> ERR[Exception Handling]
  ERR --> GER[GraphQlExceptionResolver]
  ERR --> CUSERR[Custom Error Response]

  GQL --> TEST[Testing]
  TEST --> GQT[GraphQlTest]
  TEST --> GT[GraphQlTester]

  GQL --> FILE[File Uploads]
  FILE --> MP[Multipart Request]
